<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισώζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>save alive</i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῴζειν τινὰ ὥστε
				περιεῖναι</span>
			), <i>save from death</i> or <i>ruin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.25
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν πόλιν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.5.47
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίραν χρηστὴν σεαυτῷ περιεσώσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.30
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i>escape with one's life</i>, of a prisoner, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.8.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Sam.</u>
					4.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					46.50
				</span></i>
			; of things, <i>survive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον λείψανα περισεσῶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1074b13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
